    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"disambig-see-also\"><i>See also:</i> <b class=\"Latn\"><a href=\"/wiki/b%C3%A1csi\" title=\"bácsi\">bácsi</a></b></div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Vietnamese\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vietnamese</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternative_forms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternative forms</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Etymology\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Etymology</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Pronunciation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pronunciation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Noun\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Noun</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Derived_terms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Derived terms</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Vietnamese\">Vietnamese</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Alternative_forms\">Alternative forms</h3></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/b%C3%A1c_s%E1%BB%B9#Vietnamese\" title=\"bác sỹ\">bác sỹ</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/BS#Vietnamese\" title=\"BS\">BS</a></span>, <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/BS.#Vietnamese\" title=\"BS.\">BS.</a></span> <span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#initialism\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">initialism</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3></div>\n<ul class=\"etymid\" id=\"Vietnamese:&#95;博士\" data-lang=\"vi\" data-id=\"博士\"></ul><p><a href=\"/wiki/Sino-Vietnamese\" title=\"Sino-Vietnamese\">Sino-Vietnamese</a>&#32;word from <i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%9A%E5%A3%AB#Vietnamese\" title=\"博士\">博士</a></i>, composed of&#32;<i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%9A#Vietnamese\" title=\"博\">博</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/wide#English\" title=\"wide\">wide</a>&#59; <a href=\"/wiki/vast#English\" title=\"vast\">vast</a>&#59; <a href=\"/wiki/broad#English\" title=\"broad\">broad</a></span></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>&#32;and&#32;<i class=\"Hani mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A3%AB#Vietnamese\" title=\"士\">士</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><span class=\"Latn nowrap\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/-ist#English\" title=\"-ist\">-ist</a></span></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Japanese_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Japanese language\">Japanese</a></span> <i class=\"Jpan mention\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%9A%E5%A3%AB#Japanese\" title=\"博士\">博士</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-tr tr\">hakushi</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/doctor#English\" title=\"doctor\">doctor</a></span></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span>, <span class=\"ann-pos\">person who has attained a doctorate</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, earlier <i class=\"Jpan mention\" lang=\"ja\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%9A%E5%A3%AB#Japanese\" title=\"博士\">博士</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-tr tr\">hakase</span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">Japanese court academician</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>, from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_Chinese\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Middle Chinese\">Middle Chinese</a></span> <i class=\"Hant mention\" lang=\"ltc\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%9A%E5%A3%AB#Middle_Chinese\" title=\"博士\">博士</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"ltc-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">pak dzri<sup>X</sup></span>, <span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">Chinese court academician</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>. Also probably by analogy with <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/European#English\" title=\"European\">European</a> <a href=\"/wiki/language#English\" title=\"language\">languages</a></span>, such as <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:English language\">English</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/doctor#English\" title=\"doctor\">doctor</a></i>, <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/French_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:French language\">French</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fr\"><a href=\"/wiki/docteur#French\" title=\"docteur\">docteur</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\"><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ph.D.#English\" title=\"Ph.D.\">Ph.D.</a>&#59; <a href=\"/wiki/M.D.#English\" title=\"M.D.\">M.D.</a>&#59; <a href=\"/wiki/physician#English\" title=\"physician\">physician</a></span></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>.\n</p><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronunciation\">Pronunciation</h3></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanoi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Hanoi\">Hà Nội</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ʔɓaːk̚˧˦ si˦ˀ˥]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hu%E1%BA%BF\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Huế\">Huế</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ʔɓaːk̚˦˧˥ ʂɪj˧˨]</span> ~ <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ʔɓaːk̚˦˧˥ sɪj˧˨]</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content qualifier-content\"><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saigon\">Saigon</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ʔɓaːk̚˦˥ ʂɪj˨˩˦]</span> ~ <span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ʔɓaːk̚˦˥ sɪj˨˩˦]</span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r50165410\">.mw-parser-output .k-player .k-attribution{visibility:hidden}</style><table class=\"audiotable\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; list-style: none; line-height: 1em; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0;\"><tbody><tr><td>Audio <span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saigon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Saigon\">Saigon</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span><span class=\"ib-colon qualifier-colon\">:</span></td><td class=\"audiofile\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><audio id=\"mwe_player_0\" controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" data-mw-tmh=\"\" class=\"mw-file-element\" width=\"175\" style=\"width:175px;\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"LL-Q9199_(vie)-Jessica_Nguyen_(Pamputt)-bác_sĩ.wav\" data-mwprovider=\"wikimediacommons\"><source src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f6/LL-Q9199_%28vie%29-Jessica_Nguyen_%28Pamputt%29-b%C3%A1