    "wikitext": "{{also|bácsi}}\n==Vietnamese==\n\n===Alternative forms===\n* {{l|vi|bác sỹ}}\n* {{alt|vi|BS|BS.||initialism}}\n\n===Etymology===\n{{vi-etym-sino|博|{{l|en|[[wide]]; [[vast]]; [[broad]]}}|士|{{l|en|-ist}}|suffix=sĩ}}, from {{bor|vi|ja|博士|tr=hakushi||{{l|en|doctor}}|pos=person who has attained a doctorate}}, earlier {{m|ja|博士|tr=hakase||Japanese court academician}}, from {{der|vi|ltc|博士||Chinese court academician}}. Also probably by analogy with {{l|en|[[European]] [[language]]s}}, such as {{cog|en|doctor}}, {{cog|fr|docteur||{{l|en|[[Ph.D.]]; [[M.D.]]; [[physician]]}}}}.\n\n===Pronunciation===\n{{vi-IPA}}\n* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199_(vie)-Jessica_Nguyen_(Pamputt)-bác_sĩ.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}\n\n===Noun===\n{{vi-noun}}\n\n# {{l|en|a [[medical]] [[doctor]]; a [[physician]]}}\n#: {{syn|vi|đốc-tờ}}\n#: {{uxi|vi|chữ bác sĩ|a doctor's handwriting}}\n\n====Derived terms====\n{{col3|vi|bác sĩ nhi<tr:{{vi-l|博士兒}}>|bác sĩ chuyên khoa}}\n\n===See also===\n* {{vi-l|y sĩ}}\n* {{vi-l|dược sĩ||{{l|en|pharmacist}}}}\n\n{{C|vi|Healthcare occupations}}"
